<title>USA: Buckle sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Buckle sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>KEARNEY, Neb. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buckle Inc said Thursday its board had authorized a two-for-one stock split, payable April 24, record April 14.</p>
</text>
